<title>POLAND: BWR TO ISSUE TWO MLN SHARES FOR MERGER.</title>
<headline>BWR TO ISSUE TWO MLN SHARES FOR MERGER.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish Bank Wspolpracy Regionalnej SA (BWR) shareholders will vote on June 11 on a 1,997,250-new-share issue for a planned merger with BWR Bank Secesyjny SA, BWR said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>BWR said according to the plan Secesyjny's shareholders would get 25 BWR's shares for each held in Secesyjny to conclude the merger.</p>
<p>BWR, which currently has a 40.1-percent stake in Secesyjny, has 12 million shares oustanding and Secesyjny 99,645 shares.</p>
<p>Secesyjny had a net profit of 1.1 million zlotys in 1996 and its balance sheet total amounted to 57.1 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
